§§ `s 376E`

-- s 376E(4): sexual grooming of minor below 16 years of age
-- @fixture `Grooming 376E(4) via 1 a` OF `Grooming Facts`
-- S victim = "Lim Mei Ling"
-- S the manner = "by the act charged"
-- T A is of or above 18 years of age
-- T A has met or communicated with B on at least one previous occasion
-- T A intentionally meets B in Singapore
-- T A intends, during or after the meeting, to do in Singapore anything to or in respect of B which will involve the commission by A of a relevant offence
-- T B is below 16 years of age
-- T A does not reasonably believe that B is of or above 16 years of age
-- T B is below 14 years of age and A does not reasonably believe that B is of or above 14 years of age
-- @end
#ASSERT `offence under s 376E(4)` `Grooming 376E(4) via 1 a`
#ASSERT (`charge under s 376E(4)` `Grooming 376E(4) via 1 a`)'s `made out`
