§§ `Hand-written cases: exact words of a charge`

-- The charge's words are the opening words every charge shares, the offence's recital, and the closing words
-- (CPC s 123): written here from the recital each section's spec states, not read from output.
-- s 372, by intent
#ASSERT (`charge under s 372` `Selling Minor 372 via 1`)'s text EQUALS "You, Tan Ah Kow, are charged that you, on or about the 1st day of March 2025, at about 9.30 pm, at Block 123 Ang Mo Kio Avenue 3, Singapore, did sell, let to hire or otherwise dispose of one Lim Mei Ling, a person below 21 years of age, with intent that the said person should be employed or used for the purpose of prostitution or illicit intercourse or for an unlawful and immoral purpose, to wit, by the act charged, and you have thereby committed an offence punishable under section 372 of the Penal Code 1871."
-- s 372, by knowledge that it was likely
#ASSERT (`charge under s 372` `Selling Minor 372 via 2`)'s text EQUALS "You, Tan Ah Kow, are charged that you, on or about the 1st day of March 2025, at about 9.30 pm, at Block 123 Ang Mo Kio Avenue 3, Singapore, did sell, let to hire or otherwise dispose of one Lim Mei Ling, a person below 21 years of age, knowing it to be likely that the said person would be employed or used for such a purpose, to wit, by the act charged, and you have thereby committed an offence punishable under section 372 of the Penal Code 1871."
-- s 373
#ASSERT (`charge under s 373` `Buying Minor 373 via 1`)'s text EQUALS "You, Tan Ah Kow, are charged that you, on or about the 1st day of March 2025, at about 9.30 pm, at Block 123 Ang Mo Kio Avenue 3, Singapore, did buy, hire or otherwise obtain possession of one Lim Mei Ling, a person below 21 years of age, with intent that the said person should be employed or used for the purpose of prostitution or illicit intercourse or for an unlawful and immoral purpose, to wit, by the act charged, and you have thereby committed an offence punishable under section 373 of the Penal Code 1871."
-- s 373A (a), (b), (c)
#ASSERT (`charge under s 373A` `Importing Woman 373A via 1`)'s text EQUALS "You, Tan Ah Kow, are charged that you, on or about the 1st day of March 2025, at about 9.30 pm, at Block 123 Ang Mo Kio Avenue 3, Singapore, did bring, or assist in bringing, into Singapore one Lim Mei Ling, a woman, by false pretence, false representation or fraudulent or deceitful means, with intent that she be employed or used for the purpose of prostitution, to wit, by the act charged, and you have thereby committed an offence punishable under section 373A of the Penal Code 1871."
#ASSERT (`charge under s 373A` `Importing Woman 373A via 2`)'s text EQUALS "You, Tan Ah Kow, are charged that you, on or about the 1st day of March 2025, at about 9.30 pm, at Block 123 Ang Mo Kio Avenue 3, Singapore, did bring, or assist in bringing, into Singapore one Lim Mei Ling, a woman, with intent that she be sold or bought for the purpose of prostitution, to wit, by the act charged, and you have thereby committed an offence punishable under section 373A of the Penal Code 1871."
#ASSERT (`charge under s 373A` `Importing Woman 373A via 3`)'s text EQUALS "You, Tan Ah Kow, are charged that you, on or about the 1st day of March 2025, at about 9.30 pm, at Block 123 Ang Mo Kio Avenue 3, Singapore, did sell or buy one Lim Mei Ling, a woman, for the purpose of prostitution, to wit, by the act charged, and you have thereby committed an offence punishable under section 373A of the Penal Code 1871."
-- s 376B(1)
#ASSERT (`charge under s 376B(1)` `Commercial Sex 376B(1) via 1`)'s text EQUALS "You, Tan Ah Kow, are charged that you, on or about the 1st day of March 2025, at about 9.30 pm, at Block 123 Ang Mo Kio Avenue 3, Singapore, did obtain for consideration the sexual services of one Lim Mei Ling, a person below 18 years of age, to wit, by the act charged, and you have thereby committed an offence punishable under section 376B(1) of the Penal Code 1871."
-- a refusal names what is missing and quotes the Code (CPC s 123(5)): nothing established
#ASSERT (`charge under s 372` `Selling Minor 372 nothing established`)'s refusal EQUALS "A charge under section 372 would assert that the facts fulfil every legal condition of selling minor for purposes of prostitution, etc. (CPC s 123(5)). On the facts given they do not: the accused sells, lets to hire, or otherwise disposes of a person below 21 years of age; the accused intends that the person be employed or used for prostitution, illicit intercourse or an unlawful and immoral purpose, or knows it to be likely; the elements of section 372 taken together."
-- the particulars of a joint charge appear (s 34): the same facts with a common intention
`s 372 joint particulars` MEANS Particulars WITH
    accused            IS "Tan Ah Kow"
    date               IS "the 1st day of March 2025"
    time               IS "9.30 pm"
    place              IS "Block 123 Ang Mo Kio Avenue 3"
    `co-accused`       IS "Lee Boon Keng"
    `common intention` IS TRUE

-- @fixture `Selling Minor 372 joint` OF `Selling Minor Facts`
-- E particulars = `s 372 joint particulars`
-- S victim = "Lim Mei Ling"
-- S the manner = "by the act charged"
-- T the accused sells, lets to hire, or otherwise disposes of a person
-- T the person is below 21 years of age
-- T the accused intends that the person shall at any age be employed or used for the purpose of prostitution or illicit intercourse with any person or for any unlawful and immoral purpose
-- @end
#ASSERT (`charge under s 372` `Selling Minor 372 joint`)'s text EQUALS "You, Tan Ah Kow, are charged that you, on or about the 1st day of March 2025, at about 9.30 pm, at Block 123 Ang Mo Kio Avenue 3, Singapore, together with Lee Boon Keng and in furtherance of the common intention of you all, did sell, let to hire or otherwise dispose of one Lim Mei Ling, a person below 21 years of age, with intent that the said person should be employed or used for the purpose of prostitution or illicit intercourse or for an unlawful and immoral purpose, to wit, by the act charged, and you have thereby committed an offence punishable under section 372 read with section 34 of the Penal Code 1871."

§§ `ss 372 and 373 - the Explanations (FORK DEF-B1)`

-- s 372 Explanation: "When a female below 21 years of age is sold, let for hire, or otherwise disposed of to a prostitute
-- or to any person who keeps or manages a brothel, the person so disposing of such female shall, until the contrary is
-- proved, be presumed to have disposed of her with the intent that she shall be used for the purpose of prostitution."
-- The two conditions are the inputs (female below 21; disposal to a prostitute or brothel-keeper), in that order.
#ASSERT `s 372 Explanation the intent that she shall be used for prostitution` TRUE TRUE EQUALS `presumed, until the contrary is proved, to have had the intent that she shall be used for the purpose of prostitution`
-- a male, or a female of 21 or over, or a disposal to someone else: the Explanation does not speak (a grant limited by its own wording: NOTHING-kind, not a "no")
#ASSERT `s 372 Explanation the intent that she shall be used for prostitution` TRUE FALSE EQUALS `not covered by this Explanation`
#ASSERT `s 372 Explanation the intent that she shall be used for prostitution` FALSE TRUE EQUALS `not covered by this Explanation`
#ASSERT `s 372 Explanation the intent that she shall be used for prostitution` FALSE FALSE EQUALS `not covered by this Explanation`
-- s 373 Explanation: "Any prostitute, or any person keeping or managing a brothel, who buys, hires or otherwise obtains possession
-- of a female below 21 years of age shall, until the contrary is proved, be presumed to have obtained possession of such female
-- with the intent that she shall be used for the purpose of prostitution."
-- The inputs: the person obtaining is a prostitute or brothel-keeper; the person obtained is a female below 21.
#ASSERT `s 373 Explanation the intent that she shall be used for prostitution` TRUE TRUE EQUALS `presumed, until the contrary is proved, to have had the intent that she shall be used for the purpose of prostitution`
#ASSERT `s 373 Explanation the intent that she shall be used for prostitution` TRUE FALSE EQUALS `not covered by this Explanation`
#ASSERT `s 373 Explanation the intent that she shall be used for prostitution` FALSE TRUE EQUALS `not covered by this Explanation`
#ASSERT `s 373 Explanation the intent that she shall be used for prostitution` FALSE FALSE EQUALS `not covered by this Explanation`
-- the age line of both sections is the helper's: below 21 is 20, not 21
#ASSERT `below 21 years of age` 20
#ASSERT NOT (`below 21 years of age` 21)

§§ `s 376B(4) - "sexual services"`

-- "sexual services" means any sexual services involving (a) penetration of the vagina or anus by a part of another's body
-- (other than the penis) or by anything else, (b) penetration of the vagina, anus or mouth by a man's penis, (c) touching which is sexual.
-- A closed definition ("means"): the text's own no is JUST FALSE.
#ASSERT `s 376B(4) the services are sexual services` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 376B(4) the services are sexual services` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 376B(4) the services are sexual services` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 376B(4) the services are sexual services` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 376B(4) the services are sexual services` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

§§ `s 376C - the offence defined over s 376B (FORK DEF-B2)`

-- (1) A citizen or permanent resident who does, outside Singapore, any act that would, if done in Singapore, constitute an offence under 376B.
-- @fixture `Abroad 376C(1) over 376B(1)` OF `Commercial Sex Abroad Facts`
-- S victim = "Lim Mei Ling"
-- S the manner = "by paying the said minor in Batam for sexual intercourse"
-- T the accused is a citizen or a permanent resident of Singapore
-- T the accused does the act outside Singapore
-- E the act that would, if done in Singapore, constitute an offence under section 376B = `Commercial Sex 376B(1) via 1`
-- @end
#ASSERT `offence under s 376C(2)` `Abroad 376C(1) over 376B(1)`
#ASSERT (`charge under s 376C(2)` `Abroad 376C(1) over 376B(1)`)'s `made out`
#ASSERT (`charge under s 376C(2)` `Abroad 376C(1) over 376B(1)`)'s section EQUALS "376C(2)"
#ASSERT (`charge under s 376C(2)` `Abroad 376C(1) over 376B(1)`)'s offence EQUALS "commercial sex with minor below 18 years of age outside Singapore"
-- (2): the same punishment as an offence under 376B; here the act would be one under 376B(1), whose words are 7 years, or fine, or both
#ASSERT (`charge under s 376C(2)` `Abroad 376C(1) over 376B(1)`)'s punishment EQUALS "imprisonment for a term which may extend to 7 years, or with fine, or with both"
#ASSERT (`charge under s 376C(2)` `Abroad 376C(1) over 376B(1)`)'s text EQUALS "You, Tan Ah Kow, are charged that you, on or about the 1st day of March 2025, at about 9.30 pm, at Block 123 Ang Mo Kio Avenue 3, Singapore, being a citizen or a permanent resident of Singapore, did outside Singapore an act, to wit, which would, if done in Singapore, constitute an offence under section 376B of the Penal Code 1871, to wit, by paying the said minor in Batam for sexual intercourse, and you have thereby committed an offence punishable under section 376C(2) of the Penal Code 1871."
-- over 376B(2) the punishment is 376B(2)'s: 2 years, or fine, or both
-- @fixture `Abroad 376C(1) over 376B(2)` OF `Commercial Sex Abroad Facts`
-- S victim = "Lim Mei Ling"
-- S the manner = "by messaging the said minor from Batam"
-- T the accused is a citizen or a permanent resident of Singapore
-- T the accused does the act outside Singapore
-- E the act that would, if done in Singapore, constitute an offence under section 376B = `Commercial Sex 376B(2) via 1`
-- @end
#ASSERT `offence under s 376C(2)` `Abroad 376C(1) over 376B(2)`
#ASSERT (`charge under s 376C(2)` `Abroad 376C(1) over 376B(2)`)'s punishment EQUALS "imprisonment for a term which may extend to 2 years, or with fine, or with both"
-- (1A) A, who does in Singapore any act involving a person below 18 (B) who is outside Singapore, that would if B were in Singapore constitute an offence under 376B.
-- A need not be a citizen or a permanent resident.
-- @fixture `Abroad 376C(1A)` OF `Commercial Sex Abroad Facts`
-- S victim = "Lim Mei Ling"
-- S the manner = "by chatting with the said minor in Batam from Singapore"
-- T the accused does the act in Singapore
-- T the act involves a person below 18 years of age
-- T the person below 18 years of age is outside Singapore
-- E the act that would, if done in Singapore, constitute an offence under section 376B = `Commercial Sex 376B(2) via 1`
-- @end
#ASSERT `offence under s 376C(2)` `Abroad 376C(1A)`
#ASSERT (`charge under s 376C(2)` `Abroad 376C(1A)`)'s `made out`
#ASSERT (`charge under s 376C(2)` `Abroad 376C(1A)`)'s punishment EQUALS "imprisonment for a term which may extend to 2 years, or with fine, or with both"
-- (1B) Any person who does outside Singapore any act involving a person below 18 who is in Singapore, that would if done in Singapore constitute an offence under 376B.
-- @fixture `Abroad 376C(1B)` OF `Commercial Sex Abroad Facts`
-- S victim = "Lim Mei Ling"
-- S the manner = "by arranging to meet the said minor, who was in Singapore"
-- T the accused does the act outside Singapore
-- T the act involves a person below 18 years of age
-- T the person below 18 years of age is in Singapore
-- E the act that would, if done in Singapore, constitute an offence under section 376B = `Commercial Sex 376B(1) via 1`
-- @end
#ASSERT `offence under s 376C(2)` `Abroad 376C(1B)`
#ASSERT (`charge under s 376C(2)` `Abroad 376C(1B)`)'s `made out`
#ASSERT (`charge under s 376C(2)` `Abroad 376C(1B)`)'s punishment EQUALS "imprisonment for a term which may extend to 7 years, or with fine, or with both"
-- not made out: a citizen who does the act in Singapore (no limb of 376C(1), (1A) or (1B))
-- @fixture `Abroad citizen acting in Singapore` OF `Commercial Sex Abroad Facts`
-- S victim = "Lim Mei Ling"
-- S the manner = "by the act charged"
-- T the accused is a citizen or a permanent resident of Singapore
-- T the accused does the act in Singapore
-- E the act that would, if done in Singapore, constitute an offence under section 376B = `Commercial Sex 376B(1) via 1`
-- @end
#ASSERT NOT (`offence under s 376C(2)` `Abroad citizen acting in Singapore`)
-- not made out: not a citizen or permanent resident, act outside Singapore, no minor involved who is in Singapore (1) fails
-- @fixture `Abroad foreigner acting abroad` OF `Commercial Sex Abroad Facts`
-- S victim = "Lim Mei Ling"
-- S the manner = "by the act charged"
-- T the accused does the act outside Singapore
-- E the act that would, if done in Singapore, constitute an offence under section 376B = `Commercial Sex 376B(1) via 1`
-- @end
#ASSERT NOT (`offence under s 376C(2)` `Abroad foreigner acting abroad`)
-- not made out: (1A) needs B outside Singapore; B in Singapore with the act done in Singapore is not (1A)
-- @fixture `Abroad 1A with B in Singapore` OF `Commercial Sex Abroad Facts`
-- S victim = "Lim Mei Ling"
-- S the manner = "by the act charged"
-- T the accused does the act in Singapore
-- T the act involves a person below 18 years of age
-- T the person below 18 years of age is in Singapore
-- E the act that would, if done in Singapore, constitute an offence under section 376B = `Commercial Sex 376B(1) via 1`
-- @end
#ASSERT NOT (`offence under s 376C(2)` `Abroad 1A with B in Singapore`)
-- not made out: the territorial limb is met but the act would not be an offence under 376B
-- @fixture `Abroad territorial limb only` OF `Commercial Sex Abroad Facts`
-- S victim = "Lim Mei Ling"
-- S the manner = "by the act charged"
-- T the accused is a citizen or a permanent resident of Singapore
-- T the accused does the act outside Singapore
-- E the act that would, if done in Singapore, constitute an offence under section 376B = `Commercial Sex 376B(1) nothing established`
-- @end
#ASSERT NOT (`offence under s 376C(2)` `Abroad territorial limb only`)
#ASSERT NOT (`charge under s 376C(2)` `Abroad territorial limb only`)'s `made out`
#ASSERT (`charge under s 376C(2)` `Abroad territorial limb only`)'s text EQUALS ""
#ASSERT NOT ((`charge under s 376C(2)` `Abroad territorial limb only`)'s refusal EQUALS "")
-- @fixture `Abroad nothing established` OF `Commercial Sex Abroad Facts`
-- E the act that would, if done in Singapore, constitute an offence under section 376B = `Commercial Sex 376B(1) nothing established`
-- @end
#ASSERT NOT (`offence under s 376C(2)` `Abroad nothing established`)

