§§ `s 376F(5) - "mental disability"`

-- "mental disability" means an impairment of or disturbance in the functioning of the mind or brain, resulting from any
-- disability or disorder of the mind or brain, which impairs the ability to make a proper judgement in the giving of consent to sexual touching.
#ASSERT `s 376F(5) the impairment is a mental disability` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 376F(5) the impairment is a mental disability` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 376F(5) the impairment is a mental disability` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 376F(5) the impairment is a mental disability` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

§§ `s 376G - incest`

-- 376G(2): B is a close family relative of A if B is A's grandchild, child, sibling, half-sibling, parent or grandparent.
-- Read as the text's own no for any other relation (an "if" read as closing the list: marginal reading a).
#ASSERT `s 376G(2) B is a close family relative of A` grandchild EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 376G(2) B is a close family relative of A` child EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 376G(2) B is a close family relative of A` sibling EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 376G(2) B is a close family relative of A` `half-sibling` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 376G(2) B is a close family relative of A` parent EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 376G(2) B is a close family relative of A` grandparent EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 376G(2) B is a close family relative of A` `another relation` EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- 376G(5): "To avoid doubt - (a) it is not necessary for the prosecution to prove that B did consent ... and (b) it is not a defence that B did consent".
-- Flat negatives: whichever way the input is set, the answer is the text's no.
#ASSERT `s 376G(5)(a) the prosecution must prove that B did consent` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 376G(5)(a) the prosecution must prove that B did consent` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 376G(5)(b) B's consent is a defence` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 376G(5)(b) B's consent is a defence` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- 376G(4): "This section does not apply to an act of penetration mentioned in subsection (1) which would constitute an offence
-- under section 375(1)(a), 375(1A)(a), 376(2) or 376AA(1)."  The nested facts are the same act read under ss 375, 376 and 376AA.
-- 375(1)(a): a man penetrates the vagina of a woman with his penis without her consent.
-- @fixture `Act shaped like rape of a woman` OF `Sexual Penetration Facts`
-- T the accused is a man
-- T the victim is a woman
-- T penetrates the vagina of the victim with the accused's penis
-- T without the victim's consent
-- @end
#ASSERT `an act of penetration excluded from section 376G by section 376G(4)` `Act shaped like rape of a woman`
-- 375(1A)(a): a man penetrates, with his penis, the anus or mouth of another person without that person's consent.
-- @fixture `Act shaped like rape by penetration of anus or mouth` OF `Sexual Penetration Facts`
-- T the accused is a man
-- T penetrates the anus or mouth of the victim with the accused's penis
-- T without the victim's consent
-- @end
#ASSERT `an act of penetration excluded from section 376G by section 376G(4)` `Act shaped like rape by penetration of anus or mouth`
-- 376(2): sexual assault by penetration without consent
-- @fixture `Act shaped like sexual assault by penetration` OF `Sexual Penetration Facts`
-- T sexually penetrates the vagina or anus of the victim with a part of the accused's body other than a penis, or with anything else
-- T without the victim's consent
-- @end
#ASSERT `an act of penetration excluded from section 376G by section 376G(4)` `Act shaped like sexual assault by penetration`
-- 376(2) also reaches the act on a victim below 14 years of age, whether or not she consents
-- @fixture `Act shaped like sexual assault of a child who consents` OF `Sexual Penetration Facts`
-- T sexually penetrates the vagina or anus of the victim with a part of the accused's body other than a penis, or with anything else
-- T the victim is below 14 years of age
-- @end
#ASSERT `an act of penetration excluded from section 376G by section 376G(4)` `Act shaped like sexual assault of a child who consents`
-- 376AA(1): exploitative sexual penetration of a minor of or above 16 but below 18 years of age
-- @fixture `Act shaped like exploitative penetration of a minor` OF `Sexual Penetration Facts`
-- T the accused is in a relationship that is exploitative of the victim
-- T the victim is of or above 16 years of age but below 18 years of age
-- T sexually penetrates the vagina or anus of the victim with a part of the accused's body other than a penis, or with anything else
-- @end
#ASSERT `an act of penetration excluded from section 376G by section 376G(4)` `Act shaped like exploitative penetration of a minor`
-- not excluded: a consenting adult act (the 375(1)(a) shape with consent given)
-- @fixture `Consenting penile penetration` OF `Sexual Penetration Facts`
-- T the accused is a man
-- T the victim is a woman
-- T penetrates the vagina of the victim with the accused's penis
-- @end
#ASSERT NOT (`an act of penetration excluded from section 376G by section 376G(4)` `Consenting penile penetration`)
-- not excluded: the 375(1)(a) shape where the accused proves a good-faith mistake of fact as to consent (s 375(5)): it would not constitute the offence
-- @fixture `Act shaped like rape but with a proved mistake` OF `Sexual Penetration Facts`
-- T the accused is a man
-- T the victim is a woman
-- T penetrates the vagina of the victim with the accused's penis
-- T without the victim's consent
-- T proves that by reason of mistake of fact in good faith he believed that the act was done with consent
-- @end
#ASSERT NOT (`an act of penetration excluded from section 376G by section 376G(4)` `Act shaped like rape but with a proved mistake`)
-- not excluded: penetration of the vagina, without consent, but the victim is not a woman (375(1)(a) needs a woman)
-- @fixture `Penile penetration of a vagina, victim not a woman` OF `Sexual Penetration Facts`
-- T the accused is a man
-- T penetrates the vagina of the victim with the accused's penis
-- T without the victim's consent
-- @end
#ASSERT NOT (`an act of penetration excluded from section 376G by section 376G(4)` `Penile penetration of a vagina, victim not a woman`)
-- not excluded: nothing established
-- @fixture `No act of penetration` OF `Sexual Penetration Facts`
-- @end
#ASSERT NOT (`an act of penetration excluded from section 376G by section 376G(4)` `No act of penetration`)

-- the offence in 376G(1): each of the four acts alone
-- @fixture `Incest by A penetrating B` OF `Incest Facts`
-- E the act of penetration, as the facts of an offence under sections 375, 376 or 376AA = `Consenting penile penetration`
-- S victim = "Lim Mei Ling"
-- S the manner = "by having sexual intercourse with the said B, A's sister"
-- T A is of or above 16 years of age
-- T A penetrates, with A's penis, the vagina, anus or mouth of B
-- T B is of or above 16 years of age
-- T B is a close family relative of A within section 376G(2)
-- T A knows that B is a close family relative
-- @end
#ASSERT `offence under s 376G(3)` `Incest by A penetrating B`
#ASSERT (`charge under s 376G(3)` `Incest by A penetrating B`)'s `made out`
#ASSERT (`charge under s 376G(3)` `Incest by A penetrating B`)'s section EQUALS "376G(3)"
#ASSERT (`charge under s 376G(3)` `Incest by A penetrating B`)'s offence EQUALS "incest"
#ASSERT (`charge under s 376G(3)` `Incest by A penetrating B`)'s punishment EQUALS "imprisonment for a term which may extend to 5 years"
#ASSERT (`charge under s 376G(3)` `Incest by A penetrating B`)'s text EQUALS "You, Tan Ah Kow, are charged that you, on or about the 1st day of March 2025, at about 9.30 pm, at Block 123 Ang Mo Kio Avenue 3, Singapore, being of or above 16 years of age, did have sexual penetration with one Lim Mei Ling, a close family relative of or above 16 years of age, knowing that the said person was a close family relative, to wit, by having sexual intercourse with the said B, A's sister, and you have thereby committed an offence punishable under section 376G(3) of the Penal Code 1871."
-- (b)
-- @fixture `Incest by A sexually penetrating B` OF `Incest Facts`
-- E the act of penetration, as the facts of an offence under sections 375, 376 or 376AA = `Consenting penile penetration`
-- S victim = "Lim Mei Ling"
-- S the manner = "by the act charged"
-- T A is of or above 16 years of age
-- T A sexually penetrates, with a part of A's body (other than A's penis, if A is a man) or anything else, the vagina or anus of B
-- T B is of or above 16 years of age
-- T B is a close family relative of A within section 376G(2)
-- T A knows that B is a close family relative
-- @end
#ASSERT `offence under s 376G(3)` `Incest by A sexually penetrating B`
-- (c)
-- @fixture `Incest by A causing B to penetrate A` OF `Incest Facts`
-- E the act of penetration, as the facts of an offence under sections 375, 376 or 376AA = `Consenting penile penetration`
-- S victim = "Lim Mei Ling"
-- S the manner = "by the act charged"
-- T A is of or above 16 years of age
-- T A causes or permits B, a man, to penetrate, with B's penis, the vagina, anus or mouth of A
-- T B is of or above 16 years of age
-- T B is a close family relative of A within section 376G(2)
-- T A knows that B is a close family relative
-- @end
#ASSERT `offence under s 376G(3)` `Incest by A causing B to penetrate A`
-- (d)
-- @fixture `Incest by A causing B to sexually penetrate A` OF `Incest Facts`
-- E the act of penetration, as the facts of an offence under sections 375, 376 or 376AA = `Consenting penile penetration`
-- S victim = "Lim Mei Ling"
-- S the manner = "by the act charged"
-- T A is of or above 16 years of age
-- T A causes or permits B to sexually penetrate, with a part of B's body (other than B's penis, if B is a man) or anything else, the vagina or anus of A
-- T B is of or above 16 years of age
-- T B is a close family relative of A within section 376G(2)
-- T A knows that B is a close family relative
-- @end
#ASSERT `offence under s 376G(3)` `Incest by A causing B to sexually penetrate A`
-- not made out: A is below 16
-- @fixture `Incest, A below 16` OF `Incest Facts`
-- E the act of penetration, as the facts of an offence under sections 375, 376 or 376AA = `Consenting penile penetration`
-- T A penetrates, with A's penis, the vagina, anus or mouth of B
-- T B is of or above 16 years of age
-- T B is a close family relative of A within section 376G(2)
-- T A knows that B is a close family relative
-- @end
#ASSERT NOT (`offence under s 376G(3)` `Incest, A below 16`)
-- not made out: B is below 16
-- @fixture `Incest, B below 16` OF `Incest Facts`
-- E the act of penetration, as the facts of an offence under sections 375, 376 or 376AA = `Consenting penile penetration`
-- T A is of or above 16 years of age
-- T A penetrates, with A's penis, the vagina, anus or mouth of B
-- T B is a close family relative of A within section 376G(2)
-- T A knows that B is a close family relative
-- @end
#ASSERT NOT (`offence under s 376G(3)` `Incest, B below 16`)
-- not made out: B is not a close family relative
-- @fixture `Incest, B not a close family relative` OF `Incest Facts`
-- E the act of penetration, as the facts of an offence under sections 375, 376 or 376AA = `Consenting penile penetration`
-- T A is of or above 16 years of age
-- T A penetrates, with A's penis, the vagina, anus or mouth of B
-- T B is of or above 16 years of age
-- T A knows that B is a close family relative
-- @end
#ASSERT NOT (`offence under s 376G(3)` `Incest, B not a close family relative`)
-- not made out: A does not know that B is a close family relative
-- @fixture `Incest, A does not know` OF `Incest Facts`
-- E the act of penetration, as the facts of an offence under sections 375, 376 or 376AA = `Consenting penile penetration`
-- T A is of or above 16 years of age
-- T A penetrates, with A's penis, the vagina, anus or mouth of B
-- T B is of or above 16 years of age
-- T B is a close family relative of A within section 376G(2)
-- @end
#ASSERT NOT (`offence under s 376G(3)` `Incest, A does not know`)
-- not made out: no act of penetration
-- @fixture `Incest, no act` OF `Incest Facts`
-- E the act of penetration, as the facts of an offence under sections 375, 376 or 376AA = `Consenting penile penetration`
-- T A is of or above 16 years of age
-- T B is of or above 16 years of age
-- T B is a close family relative of A within section 376G(2)
-- T A knows that B is a close family relative
-- @end
#ASSERT NOT (`offence under s 376G(3)` `Incest, no act`)
-- not made out: s 376G(4), the act would constitute rape of a woman (375(1)(a)): the section does not apply
-- @fixture `Incest excluded by 376G(4)` OF `Incest Facts`
-- E the act of penetration, as the facts of an offence under sections 375, 376 or 376AA = `Act shaped like rape of a woman`
-- T A is of or above 16 years of age
-- T A penetrates, with A's penis, the vagina, anus or mouth of B
-- T B is of or above 16 years of age
-- T B is a close family relative of A within section 376G(2)
-- T A knows that B is a close family relative
-- @end
#ASSERT NOT (`offence under s 376G(3)` `Incest excluded by 376G(4)`)
#ASSERT NOT (`charge under s 376G(3)` `Incest excluded by 376G(4)`)'s `made out`
#ASSERT (`charge under s 376G(3)` `Incest excluded by 376G(4)`)'s text EQUALS ""
-- not made out: s 376G(6), A is below 18 and is a victim of an offence under 376AA in respect of the same acts
-- @fixture `Incest, A a victim of 376AA` OF `Incest Facts`
-- E the act of penetration, as the facts of an offence under sections 375, 376 or 376AA = `Consenting penile penetration`
-- T A is of or above 16 years of age
-- T A penetrates, with A's penis, the vagina, anus or mouth of B
-- T B is of or above 16 years of age
-- T B is a close family relative of A within section 376G(2)
-- T A knows that B is a close family relative
-- T A is below 18 years of age and is a victim of an offence under section 376AA in respect of the same acts
-- @end
#ASSERT NOT (`offence under s 376G(3)` `Incest, A a victim of 376AA`)
-- not made out: nothing established
-- @fixture `Incest, nothing established` OF `Incest Facts`
-- E the act of penetration, as the facts of an offence under sections 375, 376 or 376AA = `No act of penetration`
-- @end
#ASSERT NOT (`offence under s 376G(3)` `Incest, nothing established`)

§§ `s 376H(3) - rules of reading`

-- (a) a person makes a false representation if it is untrue or misleading, and that person knows that it is, or might be, untrue or misleading
#ASSERT `s 376H(3)(a) the representation is false` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 376H(3)(a) the representation is false` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 376H(3)(a) the representation is false` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 376H(3)(a) the representation is false` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (b) a representation may be express or implied: a grant limited by its own wording (a representation in no such form: NOTHING)
#ASSERT `s 376H(3)(b) the representation is express or implied` express EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 376H(3)(b) the representation is express or implied` implied EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 376H(3)(b) the representation is express or implied` `some other form of representation` EQUALS NOTHING
-- (c) a "sexually protective measure" means (i) where B is female, a device, drug or medical procedure to prevent pregnancy or sexually
-- transmitted diseases as a result of sexual intercourse; or (ii) where B is male, one to prevent sexually transmitted diseases.
-- inputs: B is female; B is male; prevents pregnancy; prevents sexually transmitted diseases
#ASSERT `s 376H(3)(c) the thing is a sexually protective measure` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 376H(3)(c) the thing is a sexually protective measure` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 376H(3)(c) the thing is a sexually protective measure` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 376H(3)(c) the thing is a sexually protective measure` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 376H(3)(c) the thing is a sexually protective measure` FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- where B is male a measure only against pregnancy is not within (ii)
#ASSERT `s 376H(3)(c) the thing is a sexually protective measure` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 376H(3)(c) the thing is a sexually protective measure` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 376H(3)(c) the thing is a sexually protective measure` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
